      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to GET /projects, the same cheap authenticated read used by the pinned credential validator. Banner generation and project creation are omitted as writes or billable.",
        "Native category is utility rather than marketing: Abyssale is an image-generation API, but Rust CATEGORIES has no marketing bucket; admitted ops are design-catalog reads (projects, designs, fonts), not campaign management."
      ]
    },
